1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,160
Unit-1 Animal Friends dot

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,660
Section B1B dot

3
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:09,080
Hi, I'm May Lee and I live in Thailand.

4
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:11,680
The elephant is my favorite animal.

5
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,460
I love elephants because they are strong and clever.

6
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:19,040
They are also a symbol of good luck here.

7
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,760
The elephant is our national animal.

8
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:30,200
Elephants look very different from other animals.

9
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,920
They are huge.They have large ears and long trunks.

10
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,760
They can pick up and carry heavy things with their trunks.

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,200
Elephants are like us in some ways.

12
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:45,000
They are very playful and love to play in the water.

13
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:47,100
They are great swimmers.

14
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,500
They are also clever.

15
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:53,340
For example, they can remember one another and places with food

16
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:55,300
and water after many years.

17
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:58,700
Elephants are very kind too.

18
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:02,300
They look after other elephants when they don't feel well.

19
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:06,300
The big elephants also help the baby ones.

20
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:10,320
Elephants are an important part of Thai life and culture.

21
00:01:11,180 --> 00:01:12,860
However, they are in danger.

22
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,620
They live in forests, but people cut down too many trees.

23
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:21,080
People also kill elephants for their ivory.

24
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,680
Every elephant counts.
